bite); SA Breath weapon (50 ft. cone of weakening gas or 50 ft. cone of fire 14d10, DC 29), crush 2d8+18 (DC 29), frightful presence (DC 28); SQ 1st, alternate form, bless, blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 10/magic, darkvision 120 ft., immunity to fire, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, luck bonus, spell resistance 25, spells (caster level 9th), vulnerability to cold, water breathing; AL LG; SV Fort +21, Ref +15, Will +20; Str 35, Dex 10, Con 23, Int 20, Wis 21, Cha 20\n\nSkills and Feats: Concentration +27, Diplomacy +25, Disguise +25, Escape Artist +20, Heal +25, Intimidate +26, Knowledge (any 2) +34, Listen +36, Search +34, Sense Motive +25, Spot +36, Swim +32, Use Magic Device +25; Alertness, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)','\n      <div topic=\"Gold Dragon\" level=\"4\"><p><h4>Gold Dragon</h4></p><p/><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Gold Dragon, Mature adult</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Huge Dragon (Fire)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>26d12+156 (325 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>60 ft., fly 200 ft. (poor), swim 60 ft.<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td><td>33 (-2 size, +25 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 33<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td><td>+26/+46<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +37 (2d8+12) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +37 (2d8+12) melee, 2 Claws +37 (2d6+6) melee, 2 Wings +36 (1d8+6) melee, Tail Slap +36 (2d6+18)